    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64152" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύ̄π-η</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pain of body</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδονή</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Phlb.</u>
				31c
			</span></i>, etc.; also, <i>sad plight</i> or <i>condition</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.152
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>pain of mind, grief</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				16
			</span></i>.
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά; δῆγμα δὲ λύπης οὐδὲν ἐφ᾽ ἧπαρ
					προσικνεῖται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					791
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί γὰρ καλὸν ζῆν βίοτον,
				ὃς λύπας φέρει</span>; <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				177
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				1217
			</span></i> (lyr.), etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρωτικὴ λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.59
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύπας προσβάλλειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					2
				</span></i>
			. 
			<i><span class="en">
				2.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. φέρειν τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					And.
					2.8
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαρά</span>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				7.1.32
			</span></i>.</div>
